cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite the accompanying preprint (below) and, where relevant, this repository."
title: "hardmap: reproducible evidence for the charge-atlas / proof-space program"
abstract: >-
  A history-preserving, scrubbed consolidation of four research projects
  (desert-map, eightfold, foundry, proof-census) with a single CLI that
  regenerates every statistic cited in the accompanying preprint, either from
  committed verified artifacts (fast tier) or from scratch (full tier).
